  "discussion": "Reporting cyber security incidents to the chief information security officer, or one of their delegates, as soon as possible after they occur or are discovered provides senior management with the opportunity to assess the impact to their organisation and to oversee any cyber security incident response activities. In addition, an organisation should be cognisant of any legislative obligations regarding the reporting of cyber security incidents to authorities.",
